{
  "id": "npc_private",
  "title": "私密欠款和不在场人物的认知边界",
  "requirements": [
    "N6"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我走进青灯酒馆找林穗。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我轻声向林穗申请赊住一晚，六铜房钱一小时后还。现在不付钱。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "amount": 6,
            "status": "待偿还"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_trade"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我说这笔欠款只由我们两个人核对，请不要向别人宣布。我现在不还钱。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我离开酒馆，步行去北林边找吴朔。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_northwood"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在这里原地等两小时，不做其他事情。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 120,
          "max": 120
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "status": "逾期"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我问吴朔：你亲眼看见我刚才在酒馆做了什么吗？我还没把事情告诉他。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_wushuo.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "debt"
          },
          "max": 0,
          "min": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我再问吴朔：我有没有欠老板娘钱，欠了多少、约好何时还？如果不知道就直说。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_wushuo.memoryStream",
          "where": {
            "kind": "debt"
          },
          "max": 0,
          "min": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）只核对账本里这笔欠款是否逾期，不把场外说明当作吴朔听见的话。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "status": "逾期"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "事实以工具与账本为准，拒绝和未完成不能叙述成成功。",
    "agency": "不额外接任务、送礼或转移钱物。",
    "language": "简体中文，不暴露工具或内部编号。",
    "continuity": "N6吴朔没有参与或获得传播，不得知道欠款金额、期限、是否逾期，也不得用全局场景事实装作亲眼看见；场外可核账而不等于角色知情。"
  }
}
